insert into portfolio_items (title, category, description, image_url, link, is_video, sort_order) values
('Bikenation','Websites','A superbike buyer decides on the exact machine, the exact colour and the exact price, and most dealer sites show a grid of stock photos with ''call for price''. Bikenation puts the whole decision on the page: every bike priced with its real specs (power, top speed, 0-100, engine and mileage), a colour configurator that prices each option as you pick it, riding gear sold alongside, and a test ride booked from the same page. Each bike is inspected across 130 points, and the site says so where a buyer spending $32,000 needs to read it.','/portfolio/websites/bikenation.webp','https://bikenation-fawn.vercel.app',false,0),
('ChurchX','App Development','A church knows roughly how many people came on Sunday and almost nothing else: who the first-timer was, whether anyone called them, which member stopped showing up three months ago. ChurchX is the management app that closes those gaps. A visitor is registered in seconds from a phone at the door, follow-ups are assigned to a real person and recorded, members drifting away surface before they are gone, and Sunday check-in, giving records and the reports leadership asks for all come from the same place.','/portfolio/apps/churchx.webp','https://churchx-one.vercel.app/login',false,1),
('OBSpad','App Development','Live production software assumes a laptop, a mouse and a desk, which is not what a church media volunteer or a solo streamer actually has. OBSpad is my own app: it turns an Android tablet or iPad into a full production desk modelled on OBS Studio, rebuilt for fingers with big targets, pinch to scale and long-press menus. Scenes and Studio Mode preview, chroma key and audio filters, USB capture cards and webcams, output to a second screen or NDI, and going live on Facebook, YouTube or Twitch with just a stream key.','/portfolio/apps/obspad.webp','https://obspad.vercel.app',false,2),
('Airspare.Ai','Websites','Nobody knows whether today is the right day to book a flight, so people either buy too early or watch the fare climb. Airspare.Ai is the product site for an AI flight platform that answers that question: real-time fare predictions telling you when to book, 200+ airlines compared in seconds, route and seat suggestions, price-drop alerts on favourite routes, and loyalty points tracked live and redeemable at checkout. The page has to make an AI claim credible, so every feature is shown as a real screen with the number it produces.','/portfolio/websites/airspare.webp','https://airspare.vercel.app',false,3),
('RentCarsNG','Websites','Renting a car in Nigeria usually means calling around, haggling, and finding out at pickup what the car actually looks like. RentCarsNG replaces that with a booking flow: filter by city, type and dates across Lagos, Abuja, Port Harcourt, Ibadan and Enugu, see the real fleet with daily naira pricing, choose self-drive or chauffeur, and confirm and pay online. Branch locations on a map, customer reviews and an off-road fleet for weddings and long trips do the convincing before anyone picks up a phone.','/portfolio/websites/rentcarsng.webp','https://rentcars-alpha.vercel.app',false,4),
('PetNG','Websites','Nigerian pet owners buy food and toys from Instagram sellers with no prices, no returns and no way to know a product is safe. PetNG is the e-commerce storefront that fixes it: shop by dog or cat, browse real categories with naira pricing, vet-approved products, free delivery over a threshold, 30-day returns, same-day dispatch and paw points on every order. Reviews from real owners and a care blog carry the trust that a first-time buyer needs before paying online.','/portfolio/websites/petng.webp','https://petng-kappa.vercel.app',false,5),
('AgricX','Websites','A farmer considering a spraying drone is comparing a serious capital purchase against a spec sheet he cannot read. AgricX sells it in his terms: cover more ground with less water and less chemical, with each drone listed by payload, flow rate and the job it does, from precision spraying and crop mapping to field scouting and variable-rate application. Pricing, pilot training, dealer locations and support are all on the page, so the buyer can get to a decision without a sales call.','/portfolio/websites/agricx.webp','https://agricx-five.vercel.app',false,6),
('Finshield','Websites','People do not hand their money to a new financial app because the copy says it is secure. This product site for a fintech earns it instead: fraud alerts that catch a suspicious charge before the customer notices, real-time monitoring, zero liability, 24,000 partner ATMs and 2% cashback, each stated as a number rather than a promise. Apple Pay, Google Pay and partner logos sit where a cautious visitor looks for proof, and every section drives at one action: open the account.','/portfolio/websites/finshield.webp','https://finshield-alpha.vercel.app',false,7),
('CONTX','Websites','A shipper choosing a cargo partner wants three answers before enquiring: can you move it, where can you move it, and where is it now. CONTX answers all three on the page. Sea, air and road freight laid out side by side, a world map of locations to buy, sell or lease containers, container specifications with prices, and shipment tracking plus a quote calculator in reach throughout. Twenty-plus years of fleet numbers carry the credibility that a first-time enquiry needs.','/portfolio/websites/contx.webp','https://contx-theta.vercel.app',false,8),
('Vik Homes','Websites','House hunting falls apart when listings live in agent phone calls and nobody can filter by what actually matters. Vik Homes is the property platform that fixes that: search by city, property type and price, browse villas, houses and cottages with real photography and verified listings, and move from search to viewing to keys in three clear steps. Local agents, upfront pricing with no hidden fees, and a list-your-home path for sellers make it work from both sides of the deal.','/portfolio/websites/vikhomes.webp','https://vikhomes.vercel.app',false,9);
